libva-v4l2-rk3399 (1.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Validation pass: 4K H.264/HEVC decode, 1080p VP8/MPEG-2 decode, 1080p30
    H.264 encode.
  * Kernel patch: the VPU2 JPEG encoder tops out at 8176x8176 (511 macroblocks
    per row); the driver advertised 8192 and silently produced a 0x0 JPEG.

